<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Treasury raises 12 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Treasury raises 12 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury said on Tuesday it sold 12 million dinars of two-year notes at its weekly auction on Sept 17, repaying maturing paper totalling 54.3 million dinars.</p>
<p>The two-year notes payable in equal annual tranches were at a 9.000-percent yield.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 54 million dinars for two-, three-, four- and five-year notes at between 9.000 and 9.5 percent.  ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
